Selenia, the Cursed Heart in BW, built to Bracket 3.5 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Selenia, the Cursed Heart :: If you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead.

# Combos in the deck
Exquisite Blood :: part of infinite drain
Bloodthirsty Conqueror :: part of infinite drain
Vito, Thorn of the Dusk Rose :: part of infinite drain

# Game Changers (3 of 3)
Demonic Tutor :: Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.
Necropotence :: Skip your draw step.
Smothering Tithe :: Whenever an opponent draws a card, that player may pay {2}. If the player doesn't, you create a Treasure token.

# Removal you can point anywhere
Swords to Plowshares :: Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.
Ayli, Eternal Pilgrim :: {1}, Sacrifice another creature: You gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.
Damn :: Destroy target creature. A creature destroyed this way can't be regenerated.
Anguished Unmaking :: Exile target nonland permanent. You lose 3 life.
Deadly Rollick :: If you control a commander, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.

# Taxes and lock pieces
Silence :: Your opponents can't cast spells this turn.
Grand Abolisher :: During your turn, your opponents can't cast spells or activate abilities of artifacts, creatures, or enchantments.
Archon of Emeria :: Each player can't cast more than one spell each turn.
Ghostly Prison :: Creatures can't attack you unless their controller pays {2} for each creature they control that's attacking you.
Rule of Law :: Each player can't cast more than one spell each turn.
Moat :: Creatures without flying can't attack.

# Card advantage
Esper Sentinel :: Whenever an opponent casts their first noncreature spell each turn, draw a card unless that player pays {X}, where X…
Archivist of Oghma :: Whenever an opponent searches their library, you gain 1 life and draw a card.
Diabolic Intent :: As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.
Gleaming Splendor :: Whenever an opponent draws their second card each turn, you create a Treasure token.
Mind Stone :: {T}: Add {C}.
Wishclaw Talisman :: This artifact enters with three wish counters on it.

